<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let us keep praising and touching His life.</l><l>Let us keep loving, denying all strife.</l><l>Let us eat, drink Him and breath Him today.</l><l>Let us enjoy Him this way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let us keep resting, abide and obey.</l><l>Let us keep listening to all He will say.</l><l>Let us keep speaking, expressing His light.</l><l>Let us dispense Christ as life.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
